&nbsp;is irrational&nbsp;</mtext><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is an integer</mtext><mo>∨</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is irrational</mtext><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is an integer</mtext><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is irrational</mtext><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is not an integer</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is not irrational&nbsp;</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is not an integer and&nbsp;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mtext>&nbsp;is not irrational</mtext><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
